      "transfer_status": "analogy_only",
      "analysis": "Both judicial systems insist that administrative or prosecutorial conclusions depend on reliable, contestable evidence and the legal consequences of errors. They concern different facts, burdens of proof, powers, and remedies; no direct transfer of the UK criminal disclosure doctrine to Dutch benefits law follows.",
      "equivalence_established": false,
      "measured_effect_difference": null,
